Zendure Energy Controller
Copyright (c) 2026 Eduard Fuchs <info@eduardfuchs.de>

Original author: Eduard Fuchs
Original project name: Zendure Energy Controller

This software was created as a private open-source project for local MQTT-based
control and diagnostics of a Zendure SolarFlow battery system in combination
with a Shelly-/Uni-Meter-compatible measurement source and optional
second-battery telemetry via MQTT/EVCC.

